$$
Thus, we have that
$$
\mathbf{w}\_{E,B}^{-u} - \mathbf{w}\_{E,B} \approx \sum\_{e=1}^{E+1}\mathbf{M}\_{e,b(u)}
abla l(\mathbf{w}\_{e-1,b(u)};u),
$$
where
$$
\mathbf{M}\_{e,b(u)}= rac{\eta\_{e-1,b(u)}}{|\mathcal{B}\_{e-1,b(u)}|}\prod\_{k=E}^{e}\prod\_{b=B-1}^{0}(\mathbf{I}-\eta\_{k,b}\mathbf{H}\_{k,b})\cdot\prod\_{b=B-1}^{b(u)+1}(\mathbf{I}-\eta\_{e-1,b}\mathbf{H}\_{e-1,b})
$$ with 
$\prod\_{k=E}^{e}\prod\_{b=B-1}^{0}(\mathbf{I}-\eta\_{k,b}\mathbf{H}\_{k,b})=:\mathbf{I}
$ for $e=E+1$.
This is different from Eq.(36), if my derivation is correct.
